## Cloudflare Workers deploy (Wrangler)

- `bun run deploy` — `wrangler deploy`
- `bun run preview` — `wrangler dev` (local Wrangler)
- `bun run cf-typegen` — regenerate `cloudflare-env.d.ts`. Run it after install and after every change to `wrangler.jsonc`: `src/app.ts` types the app as `new Hono<{ Bindings: CloudflareEnv }>()` and `tsc` needs the generated types

Bindings and `vars` declared in `wrangler.jsonc` are available, typed, on `c.env` (`c.env.MY_VAR`, `c.env.DB`) in route handlers. Local secrets in `.env`; prod via `wrangler secret put` or `wrangler deploy --secrets-file .prod.env`.
{{/if}}
